# Timing annotated gate level run. Not CI, run by hand through
# scripts/run_gl_sdf.sh, which owns the pass or fail decision. Result
# recorded in docs/GL_TIMING.md. Needs the corner SDF at sdf_max_ss.sdf
# and the powered netlist at gate_level_netlist.v.
# Both mode flags are set before the include, so every variable the cocotb
# makefiles read is final when they are read. Assignments after the include
# land after the rule targets are fixed and split the build across two
# directories, which is how incident 10 stayed hidden.
GATES := yes
SDF   := yes
include Makefile
